2026-11-06T03:00:21.2102787Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2111936Z [0m
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2112420Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2112930Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2113208Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2113480Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2114067Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2114427Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2114675Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2115183Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2115935Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2116429Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2117132Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2117980Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2118299Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2118449Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2118652Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2119000Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2119263Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2119856Z    can use Nix.
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2119983Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2120084Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2120250Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2120497Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2120871Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2124745Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2124953Z I will:
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2125245Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2125497Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2126024Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2126446Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2126788Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2127037Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2127300Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2127775Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2128135Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2139090Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2139798Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2149722Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2150209Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:00:21.2150532Z 
